{"study_accession":"PRJNA697951","secondary_study_accession":"SRP303855","title":"Effects of IL-4 conditioning on human umbilical cord blood-derived mast cells","description":"This study evaluates the effects of 96h stimulus with Interleukin 4 (100 ng/mL) on the transcriptome of human umbilical cord blood derived mast cells. Through this approach, we identify upregulation of key intraepithelial mast cell-associated transcripts and downregulation of subepithelial mast cell-associated transcripts. Replicates are technical duplicates. Samples were sequenced on an Illumina NextSeq 500. Overall design: RNA-seq analysis of human umbilical cord blood-derived mast cells grown in SCF (100 ng/mL), IL-6 (50 ng/mL) and IL-10 (10 ng/mL) and stimulated in media containing SCF with saline or IL-4 (10 ng/mL) for 96 hours","pubmed":"33637594","geo_series":"","n_samples":4,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN17690487","study_accession":"PRJNA697951","blood_class":"cord_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"CBMC_IL4STIM2","description":"CBMC_IL4STIM2","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5050297","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-02-01","attributes":[["source_name","Umbilical cord blood-derived mast cells"],["tissue","Umbilical cord blood-derived mast cells"],["age","7-9 weeks"],["treatment","10 ng/mL IL-4, 96h"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR13579236","experiment_accession":"SRX9977245","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":5282775,"base_count":401490900,"first_public":"2021-02-01","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM5050297: CBMC_IL4STIM2 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN17690489","study_accession":"PRJNA697951","blood_class":"cord_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"CBMC_IL4STIM1","description":"CBMC_IL4STIM1","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5050296","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-02-01","attributes":[["source_name","Umbilical cord blood-derived